WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.290
A string of decorative
lights glows in a window.

2
00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:07.700
One tiny bulb fails, and the
whole string can go dark.

3
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:12.770
At home, a lamp's bulb fails, and
every other lamp in the house stays on.

4
00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.260
Why does one failure
spread through the string,

5
00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:17.580
while the other stays contained?

6
00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:22.170
In this mission, you'll track charge and
energy through junctions and around loops.

7
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.820
Then you'll solve a mixed
circuit of three resistors,

8
00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:29.170
and learn where to connect
an ammeter and a voltmeter.

9
00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:33.930
Your mission: explain why one dead
bulb can darken a whole string,

10
00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:35.790
while home lamps work on their own.
